    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Peregrine Point is a game about life, death and what comes after. Play as the ghost of the former lighthouse keeper's cat as you tend to the lighthouse and guide the lost souls of recently departed cats.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This short and heartfelt game offers a thoughtful look at the impactful lives of cats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the old lighthouse top to bottom. Piece together the life of the former lighthouse keeper through the letters he left behind.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358960/extras/6223d2bd3c9fb38384aad23401d6dd51.avif?t=1748940158\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAINTAIN THE LAMP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring oil up from the basement oil room to keep the lamp lit. Polish the lense to make sure the light shines bright. The gauges let you know when oil is running low or the lamp is starting to smudge, keep both full to help guide lost souls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358960/extras/2df036328fc1cd868673aab4997ab3fd.avif?t=1748940158\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GUIDE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the lamp lit, the spirits of recently departed cats will be guided to the lighthouse. Listen to their stories and help them get to where they need to be.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358960/extras/5e56855ff73dcc7430be7e6d5206d2b5.avif?t=1748940158\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FISH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When not tending to the lamp, fill your free time by fishing on the rocky shore. Keep track of your angling achievments with the mounted fish on the wall of the keeper's bedroom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358960/extras/34cdfc493dd74fcd46984162ab814530.avif?t=1748940158\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358960/extras/b635d69fd7f6bddc19753e091dfccd61.avif?t=1748940158\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Peregrine Point is a game about life, death and what comes after. Play as the ghost of the former lighthouse keeper's cat as you tend to the lighthouse and guide the lost souls of recently departed cats.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This short and heartfelt game offers a thoughtful look at the impactful lives of cats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the old lighthouse top to bottom. Piece together the life of the former lighthouse keeper through the letters he left behind.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358960/extras/6223d2bd3c9fb38384aad23401d6dd51.avif?t=1748940158\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAINTAIN THE LAMP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring oil up from the basement oil room to keep the lamp lit. Polish the lense to make sure the light shines bright. The gauges let you know when oil is running low or the lamp is starting to smudge, keep both full to help guide lost souls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358960/extras/2df036328fc1cd868673aab4997ab3fd.avif?t=1748940158\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GUIDE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the lamp lit, the spirits of recently departed cats will be guided to the lighthouse. Listen to their stories and help them get to where they need to be.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358960/extras/5e56855ff73dcc7430be7e6d5206d2b5.avif?t=1748940158\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FISH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When not tending to the lamp, fill your free time by fishing on the rocky shore. Keep track of your angling achievments with the mounted fish on the wall of the keeper's bedroom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358960/extras/34cdfc493dd74fcd46984162ab814530.avif?t=1748940158\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358960/extras/b635d69fd7f6bddc19753e091dfccd61.avif?t=1748940158\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
